claude: true
prompt: |
  Drain the App-Shotgun karr board. A Moose distribution that mass-uploads a file list
  to FTP and SFTP targets. Delegate behaviour-relevant code to the app-shotgun-worker
  agent and release audits to app-shotgun-release-manager; follow
  .claude/rules/app-shotgun-rules.md. Verify with `prove -lr t/` before handoff.
  Never release.
